WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.070
This video covers templates.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:04.870
SOAP note templates shape
the clinical record.

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.750
Discharge templates shape
what the client takes home.

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:11.350
Open Templates to see your own
and the ones noctune includes.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.510
Switch tabs for discharge templates.

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:17.497
Other clinicians share templates
in the community library.

00:00:17.747 --> 00:00:20.777
Filter by type, and
open one to preview it.

00:00:20.947 --> 00:00:24.057
If it suits your practice,
choose Duplicate.

00:00:24.227 --> 00:00:28.297
The copy is added to your templates,
ready for you to adjust and save.

00:00:28.860 --> 00:00:31.490
To build your own, choose New Template.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.090
Copy an existing template,
start blank, or import.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:39.010
Name it, choose Create,
then edit and save.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.870
Already have a template in a document?

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:45.630
Choose Import, paste it,
and choose Organize this.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:48.280
noctune splits it into drafts, and offers

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:51.150
client-facing instructions
as a discharge template.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.950
Reusable client education
stays in your text.

00:00:54.515 --> 00:00:56.905
Nothing is saved until
you choose Save Template.

00:00:57.413 --> 00:01:00.763
Email Templates hold client
education you send often.

00:01:00.853 --> 00:01:02.773
Choose a template to preview it.

00:01:02.773 --> 00:01:05.653
Placeholders, like the
patient's name, fill in when

00:01:05.653 --> 00:01:08.283
you send, and the
Placeholder button adds more.

00:01:08.827 --> 00:01:11.227
Templates you set up on the
web are ready on iPhone.

00:01:11.227 --> 00:01:12.897
Choose them before you start recording.
